                "title": "Victorian Coat Hook",
                "description": "Victorian Coat Hook, Grandeur CHKVIC - This Grandeur hook is perfect for holding winter coats and hats; but it is so versatile it will be just as useful mounted in closets, in the bathroom for towels, in the kitchen for cooking utensils or just about anywhere you can think of. Hooks in every room is a great way to help end clutter. However, what is great about this hook is that it will look alluring no matter where you surface mount it; the unique ornate design means that the Victorian Coat Hook is stylish enough that it can be put right out in the open.\r\n",
